<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S8.SS6" title="In 8. Evaluation ‣ Ascendra: Dynamic Request Prioritization for Efficient LLM Serving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.6 </span>Serving under Heavy System Load</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S8.SS7" title="In 8. Evaluation ‣ Ascendra: Dynamic Request Prioritization for Efficient LLM Serving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.7 </span>Scaling Ascendra to Cluster of GPUs</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
