<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1. </span>Model Architecture and Batch Request Symbols Definition</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">First, we define the symbols related to the architecture of the LLM model below:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐡</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}</annotation></semantics></math>: hidden size</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐧</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{n}</annotation></semantics></math>: number of heads</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math>: head size (<math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}=\mathbf{n}\cdot\mathbf{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐡</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝐧</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝐬</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}=\mathbf{n}\cdot\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐦</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{m}</annotation></semantics></math>: FFN intermediate size</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Note:</span> If tensor parallelism is used, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> should be divided by the tensor parallelism size.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Second, we define the symbols that characterize the batch to be executed:</p>
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{p},B_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{p},B_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>: number of prefill requests in the batch, number of decode requests in the batch, <math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=B_{p}+B_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=B_{p}+B_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0},p_{1},\dots,p_{B_{p}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0},p_{1},\dots,p_{B_{p}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>: input prompt length for each prefill request in the batch.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l_{0},l_{1},\dots,l_{B_{p}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l_{0},l_{1},\dots,l_{B_{p}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>: number of prompt tokens processed up till the current batch of each prefill request in the batch.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{0},c_{1},\dots,c_{B_{p}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{0},c_{1},\dots,c_{B_{p}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>: number of prefill tokens (chunk size) to be processed in the current batch.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{l}_{0},\hat{l}_{1},\dots,\hat{l}_{B_{d}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{l}_{0},\hat{l}_{1},\dots,\hat{l}_{B_{d}-1}</annotation></semantics></math>: input prompt length plus the number of decoded token generated up to the current batch of each decode request.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>: number of prompt tokens of the prefill requests in the batch, <math id="A1.I2.i6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\sum\limits_{i=0}^{B_{p}-1}p_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\sum\limits_{i=0}^{B_{p}-1}p_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I2.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>: block size in the attention kernel. This parameter is used in FlashAttention <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Dao et al., 2022</a>)</cite>, a common kernel optimization technique adopted by current LLM serving systems (VLLM, Sarathi-Serve).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2. </span>Prefill Analysis (w.o chunking)</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We first consider the general matrix multiply(GEMM) operations. Considering a request with a prompt token length of <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>, the GEMM-related computational flops and memory access are presented in Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.2. Prefill Analysis (w.o chunking) ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Ascendra: Dynamic Request Prioritization for Efficient LLM Serving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. We refer to fetching data from HBM to SRAM as memory access.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T3.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T3.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T3.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GEMM Name</span></th>
<th id="A1.T3.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Shape of M</span></th>
<th id="A1.T3.3.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Shape of N</span></th>
