<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F14.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 14</span>. </span><span id="A1.F14.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Top row shows the goodput comparison for Ascendra, vLLM, Sarathi-Serve with Mistral-7B, LlaMA3.1-8B and Qwen-14B on <span id="A1.F14.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Openchat ShareGPT4</span> and <span id="A1.F14.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Longbench</span> text summarization dataset. Bottom row shows the flexibility of Ascendra with respect to the scale of the SLOs.</span></figcaption>
